Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.33,0:09:07.08,Announcement,,0,0,0,,The Yamato will now be traversing the heliopause.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.08,0:09:10.21,Announcement,,0,0,0,,The ship may experience some turbulence.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.21,0:09:14.19,Announcement,,0,0,0,,All crew at the line-crossing ceremony, please take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.50,0:14:49.47,Announcement,,0,0,0,,Once the Yamato leaves the heliopause, we can no longer contact Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.47,0:14:52.66,Announcement,,0,0,0,,Anyone wishing to, who has not completed the request form,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.68,0:14:54.58,Announcement,,0,0,0,,please do so at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.37,0:17:25.02,Announcement,,0,0,0,,We will soon be completing our messages to Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.02,0:17:28.31,Announcement,,0,0,0,,Anyone wishing to speak to Earth, report to the communications room.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.37,0:20:17.34,Announcement,,0,0,0,,The Yamato will now pass through the heliopause.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.31,0:01:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Message from Project Chief Todo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.11,0:01:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're already out there, at the edge of the Solar System?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.94,0:01:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,The journey to Iscandar is lengthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.57,0:02:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,We have only taken the first step.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.07,0:02:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.95,0:02:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,But word that you've destroyed the\NPluto base has reached Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.83,0:02:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,There will be no more planet bombs.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.40,0:02:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You have no idea how much relief that's brought.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.13,0:02:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Just knowing the Yamato is heading for Iscandar helps us keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.47,0:02:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Okita, retrieve the Cosmo Reverse System.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.39,0:02:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Earth awaits the Yamato's return.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.35,0:02:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It awaits your return!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.56,0:02:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The heliopause is starting to interfere with our communications.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.36,0:02:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me five minutes to prepare everything for hyperspace transmission.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.91,0:02:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's rare to see you alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.20,0:02:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought the XO would be with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.54,0:02:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You must have a lot of free time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.12,0:02:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless there's trouble on board,\Nsecurity doesn't have much to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.34,0:02:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,How are things going for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.09,0:03:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,There isn't much for me to do until we reach a new star system.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.05,0:03:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard that you've begun counseling the crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.02,0:03:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you could spend some therapy time with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.56,0:03:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop joking around.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.40,0:03:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Once past the heliopause, we'll be unable to communicate with Earth anymore, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.28,0:03:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,The captain should let everyone send at least one final message there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.62,0:03:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If he did, it could just make everyone more homesick.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.25,0:03:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep at it, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.89,0:03:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the updated shipboard duty list?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.73,0:03:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.77,0:03:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Back on Enceladus, didn't you ask me something strange?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.23,0:04:01.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you related to any aliens?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.82,0:04:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you mean Sasha?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.41,0:04:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,At first, I wasn't sure what you meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.37,0:04:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But you saw her on Mars, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.83,0:04:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I wondered.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.79,0:04:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, she looked a lot like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.71,0:04:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Sasha Iscandar...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.75,0:04:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The woman who gave her life to bring us\Nthe Wave Motion Engine's activation core.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.43,0:04:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, wasn't there another who arrived a year earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.64,0:04:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,To bring the plans for the Wave Motion Engine itself?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.52,0:04:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yurisha Iscandar.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.61,0:04:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Her name.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.49,0:04:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,A last message to Earth?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.91,0:04:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. Once we've passed the heliopause,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.66,0:04:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,powerful cosmic radiation will\Nprevent communication with Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.08,0:05:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,,So I've decided to let anyone who chooses, speak with their family.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.25,0:05:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.73,0:05:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Simultaneously,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.09,0:05:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll hold a line-crossing ceremony as we leave the Solar System.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.97,0:05:09.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Line-crossing is observed at the Equator, but this is space.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.05,0:05:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Once, sailors performed line-crossing ceremonies
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.35,0:05:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,when traversing the Equator, to ask for their ships' safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.19,0:05:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We shall do the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.24,0:05:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But Ota said you wear costumes to a traditional line-crossing ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.74,0:05:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,So he put you up to it, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.37,0:05:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You believe anything you're told, Mako.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.88,0:05:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did you go, Ota?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.79,0:05:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly, you shouldn't listen to a word he says.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.18,0:05:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I think it looks good on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.93,0:05:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.40,0:06:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, because of your efforts, Operation M-2 was a success.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.24,0:06:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,No more planet bombs will strike Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.74,0:06:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,As your captain, I thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.64,0:06:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We now begin the Solar System line-crossing ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.08,0:06:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,,But our voyage has only just begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.12,0:06:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Once this is over, do not look back toward Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.59,0:06:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Look ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.13,0:06:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your eye on the path that leads to Iscandar!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.26,0:06:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I pray for the line-crossing ceremony's success.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.76,0:06:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.40,0:06:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Want a drink, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.48,0:06:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.44,0:06:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You're no fun...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.83,0:07:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Supply Officer Hirata.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.46,0:07:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I was his classmate at the officer training academy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.57,0:07:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for agreeing to my request.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.67,0:07:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,If you dislike being a pilot, you're always welcome to come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.69,0:07:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,The deck crew drew the short straw...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.27,0:07:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Ship repairs are our top priority.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.82,0:07:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,So we don't get to talk to the folks back on Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.74,0:07:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Akemi!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.72,0:07:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,No talking on duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.20,0:07:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir! It's just that I{\fscx75}—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.08,0:07:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Enomoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.16,0:07:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Kodai?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.00,0:07:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up? You need something?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.33,0:07:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, do you require something, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.34,0:07:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,If anyone wants to speak to their family, I'll switch with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.76,0:07:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,But you...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.68,0:07:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.51,0:07:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that an order?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.26,0:07:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Enomoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.60,0:08:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that means one person will get to contact Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.69,0:08:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,No, two.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.20,0:08:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.66,0:08:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, the one who took out the\NGarmillas base with Lieutenant Kodai.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.91,0:08:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.67,0:08:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like the tactical officer has gotten better at dealing with women.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.55,0:08:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.42,0:08:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Saeki! Kishima!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.51,0:08:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys just got married, right? Trade places with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.76,0:08:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.40,0:08:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain, did you need something?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.86,0:08:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you look busy. Sorry to have bothered you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.70,0:09:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.41,0:09:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what's so fun...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.93,0:09:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Something wrong, Captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.60,0:09:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.44,0:09:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you need something?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.77,0:09:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it isn't that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.28,0:09:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for bothering you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.33,0:09:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,This way to the comms room, to talk to Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.33,0:09:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that it's finally happening, I don't know what to tell them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.41,0:09:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine... Just show them you're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.33,0:09:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you have...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.46,0:09:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,A mother and younger brother. My dad...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.34,0:10:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember. He passed away during\Nthe first encounter with the Garmillans.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.01,0:10:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,My child's been born...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.06,0:10:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, we spent all our time just thinking of a name!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.69,0:10:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your turn, Engine Officer Tokugawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.86,0:10:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,My turn?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.61,0:10:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Grandpa!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.16,0:10:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Aiko!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.37,0:10:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you? Tasuke, where are Hikoshichi and Kikuko?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.99,0:10:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.37,0:10:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,They went to stand in line for food.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.71,0:10:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Tasuke, I'm hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.34,0:10:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.49,0:10:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Recently, food hasn't been available as often.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.15,0:10:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,So they're getting it from the black market{\fscx75}—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.39,0:10:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.47,0:10:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I told them to avoid the contraband so many times!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.85,0:10:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,We know... We know, but we have no choice!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.77,0:10:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,When will you be back, Grandpa?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.23,0:10:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,A year... A year, and then I'll bring back presents.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.53,0:11:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Tasuke, look after Aiko. Earth's fate rests with you young people.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.20,0:11:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on... Man up, and be strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.25,0:11:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Tasuke, Grandpa is crying, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.92,0:11:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Jiro?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.30,0:11:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Daisuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.71,0:11:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.72,0:11:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Visiting Auntie at the hospital. She'll be back soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.72,0:11:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see, but I don't have much time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.51,0:11:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,This might be my last message to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.77,0:11:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.60,0:11:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be selfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.61,0:11:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell Mom that I'll see my mission through, just like Dad would've wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.49,0:11:48.03,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll return to Earth, no matter what. Jiro, take care of Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.83,0:11:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's almost time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.25,0:11:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.58,0:11:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom, it's Daisuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.29,0:11:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Daisuke's here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.21,0:12:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom... Wait! Just a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.26,0:12:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom! Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.43,0:12:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Daisuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.93,0:12:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you already talk to Earth?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.10,0:12:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.90,0:12:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure you don't want to?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.61,0:12:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.65,0:12:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I really am fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.28,0:12:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Could your parents be...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.58,0:12:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Marsnoids? Yes, you can tell by my eye color.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.29,0:12:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,My grandmother was born on Mars.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.30,0:12:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The Second Inner Planet War occurred right around when I was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.30,0:12:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,After that, we were forced to move to Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.35,0:12:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. So you have family on Earth?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.06,0:12:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,No, they were all killed by the planet bombs.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.27,0:13:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I had one brother left who died in battle with the Garmillans.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.32,0:13:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,So please don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.15,0:13:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.83,0:13:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of joke is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.99,0:13:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Well? Her father owns Morita Pharmaceuticals.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.58,0:13:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Your father says he knows a high-ranking official with a nice daughter, but I think...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.80,0:13:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother, consider our current situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.67,0:13:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one who won't grasp the situation. You will take over the company.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.35,0:13:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't do it! And I'll choose my own wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.97,0:13:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,All you need to do is what I tell you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.02,0:13:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Kozo...!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.35,0:13:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Yasuo, come home safely. Please...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.28,0:13:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Please forgive me. I already have someone I've decided to marry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.16,0:13:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like Nanbu's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.00,0:13:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,There are about twenty-eight people left.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.54,0:14:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, got it. By the way, I was glad to hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.84,0:14:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That you got permission for that thing you mentioned.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.96,0:14:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.55,0:14:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck. I'll put in a request when it's ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.90,0:14:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure! Anyway, it was great that the captain let us talk to Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.89,0:14:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, the one who recommended it to him was...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.94,0:14:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.10,0:14:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I wrong? Didn't you suggest it to the captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.69,0:14:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Security likes to ask questions, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.11,0:14:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't you be calling Earth, as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.91,0:14:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.41,0:14:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,That said, he's watching you...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.72,0:14:53.93,Default,,0,0,0,,He needs to relax...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.93,0:14:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You know I can't drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.06,0:14:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure you don't want to go, Captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.14,0:15:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no going back for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.06,0:15:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,My dad will just tell me how I have to take over the temple.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.74,0:15:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Mine died in the first wave of planet bombing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.07,0:15:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I hated him. He was always yelling.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.91,0:15:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But now, I find I think of him a lot. Always the times he yelled at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.47,0:15:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Jeez...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.47,0:15:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a lot of work.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.97,0:15:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,There isn't much for me to do until we reach a new star system.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.81,0:15:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,May i ask something?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.48,0:15:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you volunteer for the pilot squad first?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.53,0:15:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I did, but the squad captain didn't want to let me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.99,0:15:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean Kato? Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.54,0:16:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,He may not look it, but he's more sensitive than most to matters of life and death.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.92,0:16:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.46,0:16:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.97,0:16:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.51,0:16:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I think he didn't want me dying in combat like my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.39,0:16:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Those two were good friends. My brother and Captain Kato.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.86,0:16:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to interrupt, but could you go around, to assist the port side?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.32,0:16:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.32,0:16:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.89,0:16:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.30,0:17:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.93,0:17:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Ota... I told you to pour me a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.40,0:17:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.19,0:17:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd better drink too!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.79,0:17:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.42,0:17:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.92,0:17:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You look well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.43,0:17:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,How is Okita? I asked Doctor Sado to take care of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.22,0:17:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,He's been much calmer lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.43,0:17:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.85,0:17:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I am very grateful to you for taking care of me over this past year.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.65,0:17:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back alive, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.98,0:17:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.32,0:17:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.83,0:18:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that you, Tokugawa?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.41,0:18:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have a moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.66,0:18:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It's already been a year, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.25,0:18:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yamazaki mentioned that you dropped by the engine room.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.63,0:18:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.80,0:18:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you looking for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.47,0:18:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Tokugawa...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.10,0:18:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you remember our first ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.69,0:18:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Defense ship #36, a tiny ship they didn't even name.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.49,0:18:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,We were both so young.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.24,0:18:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Since then, how many young ones have died while we're kept living?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.42,0:19:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't even want to count... No, I cannot allow myself to count.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.05,0:19:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,People's lives are more than mere numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.35,0:19:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.52,0:19:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,All we survivors can do...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.94,0:19:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,...is ensure the young ones still have a hope for tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.61,0:19:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all we can do to atone for taking so many of their lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.12,0:19:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Good job on the repair work.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.21,0:19:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I could see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.80,0:19:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't have anything to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.84,0:19:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you talk to Earth?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.68,0:19:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,My whole family's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.76,0:19:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What about you? Were you able to reach home?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.39,0:19:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I'm the same as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.27,0:19:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.36,0:19:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.24,0:20:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't recall my past...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.24,0:20:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,All I can remember is this past year. I have no memories prior to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.75,0:20:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.63,0:20:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,At that time, the Solar System\Nline-crossing ceremony will be complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.76,0:20:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Moving on...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.34,0:20:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello! We now bring you the first edition of YRA Radio Yamato!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.51,0:20:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Your host is everyone's favorite,\NYuria Misaki! Let's begin our first song.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.73,0:20:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,An oldie but goodie, perfect for the end of the line-crossing ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.44,0:22:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell, Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.77,0:22:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We will return.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.61,0:22:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We are going to come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.83,0:22:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Then there's no problem, yes? You're Earth's last remaining hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.38,0:22:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you, Lieutenant Niimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.24,0:24:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,A trap waits in the skies.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.99,0:24:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark clouds gather, and up ahead, a red sun looms.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.16,0:24:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Its mouth is filled with burning fire,\Nand its arms are Hell's crimson flames.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.62,0:24:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire one blast,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.33,0:24:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,to break through an inescapable trap, and effect an impossible escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.17,0:24:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time: Wish Upon a Star.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.38,0:24:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,There are 343 days left before humanity is extinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.34,0:22:46.34,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}That girl was waving
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.34,0:22:50.68,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}A bright {\c&H0000FF&}red scarf
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.68,0:22:58.86,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}Who do you think it was for?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.86,0:23:02.86,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}Whoever it was
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.86,0:23:06.99,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}It doesn’t matter
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.99,0:23:15.29,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}Let each think it was for him
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.29,0:23:23.59,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}The hearts of men beginning a journey
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.59,0:23:30.60,ED,,0,1100,0,,{\fad(500,500)}Want a piece of romance
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.67,0:23:50.49,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,1000)}A bright {\c&H0000FF&}red scarf
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.00,0:21:00.28,ED,,150,150,0,,{\fad(500,500)\an8\i1\blur3\fs75}Know that I'll return.\NA bright {\c&H0000FF&}red scarf.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.28,0:21:08.50,ED,,150,150,0,,{\fad(500,500)\an8\i1\blur3\fs75}On that day, come meet me once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.50,0:21:24.97,ED,,150,150,0,,{\fad(500,500)\an8\i1\blur3\fs75}For now, I dream amongst the stars,\Nat the end of the universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.97,0:21:40.40,ED,,150,150,0,,{\fad(500,500)\an8\i1\blur3\fs75}When he travels, a man's eyes should always be full of romance.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.12,0:21:59.05,ED,,150,150,0,,{\fad(500,500)\an8\i1\blur3\fs75}A bright {\c&H0000FF&}red scarf.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.20,0:01:44.20,EP TS,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\3aH&90&\4aH&99&\fade(2250,1000)}{\pos(1053,840)}Episode 7
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.20,0:01:44.20,EP TS,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\3aH&90&\4aH&99&\fade(2250,1000)}{\pos(1053,1073)}Farewell to the Solar System
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.24,0:00:21.71,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,200)\blur7\be2}Farewell, Earth
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.71,0:00:28.97,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}The ship that is departing is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.97,0:00:36.64,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}The Space Battleship
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.64,0:00:42.69,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,2000)\blur7\be2}Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.32,0:00:47.94,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\pos(777,60)\be2}It departs now to Iscandar,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.94,0:00:52.66,OP,,900,0,0,,{\an9\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}at the end of the cosmos,\Nbearing its fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.66,0:00:59.79,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}"We will come back, no matter what it takes"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.00,0:01:08.72,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}Answer with a smile to the waving people
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.42,0:01:13.22,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}Going far from the Galaxy towards Iscandar
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.22,0:01:16.64,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}A faint gleam of hope
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.64,0:01:24.23,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,3000)\blur7\be2}The Space Battleship Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.63,0:21:50.12,TS Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\bord4\c&H000000&\3c&H828E91&}Safe Travels
